  <item>
    <title>Vol.31 串台「地摊Radio」：日本毒可乐事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af1b92f5b7c4709bfe38214</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af1b92f5b7c4709bfe38214</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:23:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1977 年的一起可乐投毒案，没有勒索信、没有宣言、没有任何诉求，凶手只是把掺了剧毒氰化物的可乐，悄悄放在街头、电话亭里，静静等待随机路过的陌生人捡起、喝下。两条生命就此逝去，凶手直到今天，都没有被抓到。</span></p><p><span>主播：</span><strong><span>「地摊Radio」</span></strong><span>马老司、白夜、狐克斯</span></p><p><span>后期：马老司</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 昭和时期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 可口可乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 可怜的小明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 又有死亡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 氰化物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 诡异的死者</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 情人节巧克力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 不同类型的犯罪心理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3311">55:11</a> 猜测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3641">60:41</a> 后续</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjNvi5VnlstPRxExaV1tnUI3JSyw.png"><p><span>当时的可乐样式</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5-YP75r3R7W0K3izJ5Wixaup35.png"><p><span>发现可乐的电话亭</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmxMGCeC0wGNNg_XFRC-MBRgg-mt.png"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fox_4OoQKe_wEA-3Nab5CotISIZK.png"><p><span>警方提醒公众</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpW1D8toEkbMg_mZNwwKbat--Rx.jpg"><p><span>案件新闻报道</span></p><p></p><p><span>资料来源by</span><strong><span>「地摊Radio」</span></strong><span>：</span></p><p><span>青酸コーラ无差别杀人事件|东京で2人死亡、同一犯未确定の大阪・青酸チョコと时効 | 日本事件データベース</span><br></p><p><span>感谢收听与分享</span></p><p><span>投稿持续征集中，全平台搜索</span><strong><span>「听我狐说」</span></strong><span>私信投稿或投稿至下方邮箱</span></p><p><span>投稿反馈：Foximmortals@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679548ed35161b3bac221e4e/lg6lLjFurs9D0oLYPS3G8Y3ziW3i.m4a" length="64344066" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmnDCi3Ldc35sGmjCNRU9CgHz2-V.png"/>
